+ *
+ * @bpp: bits per pixel for each cplanes
+ * @fourcc: pixel format in fourcc
+ * @fmt_val: the fmt val corresponding to DVP2AXI_FOR register
+ * @csi_fmt_val: the fmt val corresponding to DVP2AXI_CSI_ID_CTRL
